1
00:00:01,001 --> 00:00:04,587
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:05,463 --> 00:00:06,673
[gunshots]

3
00:00:06,756 --> 00:00:07,966
[gun clicks, fires]

4
00:00:09,426 --> 00:00:10,677
[whoosh, slashing sounds]

5
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:12,679
[machine gun fire]

6
00:00:12,762 --> 00:00:14,681
[machine gun fire continues]

7
00:00:14,764 --> 00:00:15,765
[single gunshot]

8
00:00:17,976 --> 00:00:19,811
[rapid gunfire]

9
00:00:20,979 --> 00:00:22,397
[echoing blast]

10
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:24,107
[rapid gunfire]

11
00:00:24,858 --> 00:00:25,942
[blade whooshing]

12
00:00:26,025 --> 00:00:28,445
[tense music builds]

13
00:00:28,528 --> 00:00:29,821
[blade whooshing]

14
00:00:32,365 --> 00:00:35,702
[Emilia] <i>Get out of here!</i>
<i>I will bury my own husband!</i>

15
00:00:35,785 --> 00:00:37,454
<i>What are you doing? Show Dad some respect.</i>

16
00:00:37,537 --> 00:00:39,956
<i>How dare you go against your own mother!</i>

17
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:41,416
<i>Did you hit your head again?</i>

18
00:00:41,499 --> 00:00:43,501
<i>Want me to tell everyone</i>
<i>the truth about you?! Huh?!</i>

19
00:00:43,585 --> 00:00:46,421
<i>Do you really want to bury your husband?</i>

20
00:00:46,504 --> 00:00:48,506
<i>Then go rest in peace!</i>

21
00:00:48,590 --> 00:00:49,841
[Emilia] <i>Why are you bringing me here?</i>

22
00:00:49,924 --> 00:00:52,093
[Julio] <i>Your lunacy isn't doing us</i>
<i>any good anymore.</i>

23
00:00:52,177 --> 00:00:55,013
<i>Mama, why am I here?</i>

24
00:00:55,096 --> 00:00:58,266
<i>Raul, Papa's at it again.</i>

25
00:00:58,349 --> 00:01:00,268
<i>He's always doing this to me.</i>

26
00:01:00,351 --> 00:01:03,521
[Julio] <i>I assure you the whole</i>
<i>province of Ardiente</i>

27
00:01:03,605 --> 00:01:07,108
<i>will be under my control</i>
<i>if I can take over</i>

28
00:01:07,192 --> 00:01:09,277
<i>Helena Montoya's organization.</i>

29
00:01:09,360 --> 00:01:11,863
<i>And what makes you think</i>
<i>we'll hand it over to you?</i>

30
00:01:11,946 --> 00:01:15,325
<i>I am the only ally of Helena to Ardiente.</i>

31
00:01:15,408 --> 00:01:16,910
<i>Then give me the password.</i>

32
00:01:17,952 --> 00:01:19,996
[Arnaldo] <i>What are you guys up to?</i>

33
00:01:20,080 --> 00:01:23,166
<i>I think we're being followed.</i>
<i>We have to lose them, Jepoy.</i>

34
00:01:23,249 --> 00:01:25,418
[Arnaldo] <i>You can't run from me.</i>

35
00:01:25,502 --> 00:01:27,212
[Anna] <i>Jepoy, watch out for that truck!</i>

36
00:01:27,295 --> 00:01:29,088
[driver] <i>Hey, watch where you're going!</i>

37
00:01:29,172 --> 00:01:31,883
[Arnaldo] <i>You can run, but you can't hide.</i>

38
00:01:31,966 --> 00:01:35,094
[Lily] <i>Starting tomorrow,</i>
<i>I will be Diego's wife.</i>

39
00:01:35,178 --> 00:01:37,597
[Arnaldo] <i>I want your men to</i>
<i>search Poblacion Ardiente</i>

40
00:01:37,680 --> 00:01:39,808
<i>for a white van with this plate number.</i>

41
00:01:39,891 --> 00:01:41,434
<i>I'll be gone for a while.</i>

42
00:01:41,518 --> 00:01:44,521
<i>So, it'll be just you</i>
<i>and Grandpa for a while.</i>

43
00:01:44,604 --> 00:01:47,899
<i>Help him take over Grandma's syndicate.</i>

44
00:01:47,982 --> 00:01:49,359
<i>Everything's going to be fine.</i>

45
00:01:52,445 --> 00:01:55,115
[soft music playing]

46
00:03:00,763 --> 00:03:03,474
[soft music continues playing]

47
00:03:51,147 --> 00:03:55,485
[bright instrumental playing]

48
00:04:17,090 --> 00:04:18,091
<i>Nanny Loring…</i>

49
00:04:19,634 --> 00:04:20,635
<i>Uncle Pandoy…</i>

50
00:04:22,470 --> 00:04:23,471
<i>Dad…</i>

51
00:04:25,682 --> 00:04:29,978
<i>Please join me</i>
<i>on this special day in my life.</i>

52
00:04:32,939 --> 00:04:37,235
<i>Someday, we'll all meet again.</i>

53
00:04:58,506 --> 00:05:01,092
<i>Dad, please join us</i>

54
00:05:01,175 --> 00:05:04,804
<i>as Diego and I start</i>
<i>our new lives together.</i>

55
00:05:15,732 --> 00:05:18,151
Okay. Thank you. Go inside for now.

56
00:05:24,115 --> 00:05:25,658
[phone ringing]

57
00:05:27,744 --> 00:05:28,911
[phone ringing]

58
00:05:29,954 --> 00:05:31,122
Well?

59
00:05:31,205 --> 00:05:33,624
Mayor, we've tracked them down.

60
00:05:34,167 --> 00:05:35,626
<i>They're at the St. Monica chapel</i>

61
00:05:36,169 --> 00:05:37,420
in Rosario.

62
00:05:38,463 --> 00:05:39,464
Okay. Thank you.

63
00:05:52,185 --> 00:05:57,565
["Sa'Yo" instrumental playing]

64
00:07:22,400 --> 00:07:26,404
["Sa'Yo" instrumental continues]

65
00:07:38,166 --> 00:07:41,627
-<i>Hey, don't jump! Hey!</i>
-[young Diego screams]

66
00:07:41,711 --> 00:07:44,088
[young Lily] <i>If it weren't for me,</i>
<i>you would've fallen off the cliff.</i>

67
00:07:44,172 --> 00:07:45,548
[young Diego] <i>Who are you? Wonder Woman?</i>

68
00:07:45,631 --> 00:07:47,884
[young Lily] <i>No. My name is Lily.</i>

69
00:07:48,968 --> 00:07:52,638
[young Diego] <i>Lily…</i>
<i>Thanks for helping me out.</i>

70
00:07:52,722 --> 00:07:55,057
[young Lily] <i>No worries. I got you!</i>

71
00:07:56,809 --> 00:07:59,145
<i>Thank you, Lily!</i>

72
00:07:59,228 --> 00:08:01,731
<i>You're welcome, Diego. </i>[giggles]

73
00:08:01,814 --> 00:08:02,815
<i>Let's go.</i>

74
00:08:20,625 --> 00:08:22,752
[townsfolk cheering]

75
00:08:22,835 --> 00:08:27,632
[Pandoy] <i>The one and only</i>
<i>Diego Ardiente-Torillo!</i>

76
00:08:27,715 --> 00:08:32,261
[Lily] <i>It's Diego. That's him.</i>
<i>My best friend.</i>

77
00:08:32,345 --> 00:08:33,971
[stutters] <i>For you.</i>

78
00:08:34,972 --> 00:08:36,891
[Lily] <i>I really wanted</i>
<i>to tell him everything.</i>

79
00:08:38,726 --> 00:08:43,272
<i>But then I thought,</i>
<i>if he finds out the truth,</i>

80
00:08:44,774 --> 00:08:47,693
<i>he'll hate me.</i>

81
00:08:49,278 --> 00:08:51,239
<i>It's better this way.</i>

82
00:08:52,949 --> 00:08:55,409
<i>Just let Lily live in his memory.</i>

83
00:08:56,661 --> 00:09:01,374
<i>Lily is just a memory to me and Diego.</i>

84
00:09:21,644 --> 00:09:23,062
[Diego] <i>I can't explain it.</i>

85
00:09:23,145 --> 00:09:28,651
<i>Whenever we're together,</i>
<i>I feel like I'm with Lily again.</i>

86
00:09:28,734 --> 00:09:30,278
<i>By being with you.</i>

87
00:09:30,861 --> 00:09:32,863
<i>Do you think it's a bad thing</i>

88
00:09:32,947 --> 00:09:35,866
<i>that Ivy reminds me so much of Lily?</i>

89
00:09:35,950 --> 00:09:38,661
<i>I just noticed they have</i>
<i>so many similarities.</i>

90
00:09:38,744 --> 00:09:41,289
<i>How she pinches Butchoy's cheeks.</i>

91
00:09:41,372 --> 00:09:42,832
<i>How she likes pinwheels.</i>

92
00:09:42,915 --> 00:09:46,335
<i>Her reaction when I took her to Lily's</i>
<i>old house and the secret garden.</i>

93
00:09:46,419 --> 00:09:47,670
<i>And now this.</i>

94
00:09:47,753 --> 00:09:49,630
<i>Why is she helping us?</i>

95
00:09:49,714 --> 00:09:52,758
[Loring] <i>Let's say that she is Lily.</i>

96
00:09:52,842 --> 00:09:55,177
<i>Then why does she need to pretend?</i>

97
00:09:55,261 --> 00:09:56,887
[Diego] <i>That's what I have to find out.</i>

98
00:09:56,971 --> 00:09:58,973
-[Lily] <i>Diego!</i>
-[Diego] <i>Ivy?</i>

99
00:09:59,056 --> 00:10:00,641
<i>Diego, help us, please!</i>

100
00:10:01,058 --> 00:10:03,102
<i>My mother needs help, please!</i>

101
00:10:03,185 --> 00:10:04,687
<i>Answer me right now.</i>

102
00:10:04,770 --> 00:10:07,273
<i>Are Ivy Aguas and Lily Cruz</i>
<i>the same person?</i>

103
00:10:07,857 --> 00:10:08,983
<i>Yes, Diego.</i>

104
00:10:09,066 --> 00:10:12,194
<i>I'm your old friend. I'm Lily.</i>

105
00:10:12,278 --> 00:10:17,283
[Diego] <i>Ivy, whatever your plans</i>
<i>are, I'm here for you.</i>

106
00:10:17,366 --> 00:10:18,784
<i>Because I love you.</i>

107
00:10:21,662 --> 00:10:25,666
["Sa'Yo" instrumental playing]

108
00:10:36,719 --> 00:10:38,554
[Diego] <i>Ivy, I don't care</i>
<i>how powerful they are.</i>

109
00:10:38,638 --> 00:10:42,224
<i>Nothing is impossible when I'm with you.</i>

110
00:10:42,308 --> 00:10:45,853
<i>That's why I believe that</i>
<i>we can get through all this.</i>

111
00:10:45,936 --> 00:10:47,229
<i>Stop the wedding!</i>

112
00:10:49,565 --> 00:10:50,524
<i>Hurry!</i>

113
00:10:50,608 --> 00:10:53,694
<i>Ivy, I'm right here. We did it!</i>

114
00:10:53,778 --> 00:10:56,489
<i>Ivy, I want you to be happy.</i>

115
00:10:56,572 --> 00:10:59,867
<i>I want you to be free of this burden.</i>

116
00:10:59,950 --> 00:11:02,703
<i>And I hope I'll be there with you.</i>

117
00:11:02,787 --> 00:11:04,705
[Lily] <i>Diego, I love you.</i>

118
00:11:04,789 --> 00:11:08,376
[Diego] <i>Ivy, I'll do everything</i>
<i>I can to put an end to this.</i>

119
00:11:08,459 --> 00:11:11,379
<i>I'll make sure your plans succeed.</i>

120
00:11:11,462 --> 00:11:13,005
<i>Even if it costs me my life,</i>

121
00:11:14,507 --> 00:11:17,301
<i>I won't let anything happen to you.</i>

122
00:11:17,385 --> 00:11:18,386
[Lily] <i>Thank you.</i>

123
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:24,100
<i>Thank you for keeping your promise to me…</i>

124
00:11:24,183 --> 00:11:26,852
<i>that you'd help my plans succeed.</i>

125
00:11:26,936 --> 00:11:29,063
<i>I hope you'll be with me</i>
<i>till the very end.</i>

126
00:11:30,272 --> 00:11:33,818
<i>I know we're in</i>
<i>the middle of a war, Diego.</i>

127
00:11:33,901 --> 00:11:37,696
<i>But I think it's worth the fight</i>
<i>when you aren't alone.</i>

128
00:11:37,780 --> 00:11:39,782
<i>From now on,</i>

129
00:11:39,865 --> 00:11:41,075
<i>let's make it official.</i>

130
00:11:42,785 --> 00:11:43,953
<i>Will you be mine?</i>

131
00:11:44,662 --> 00:11:47,081
<i>Yes. I'm all yours.</i>

132
00:11:52,795 --> 00:11:54,547
[Diego] <i>We've been through so much.</i>

133
00:11:55,965 --> 00:11:58,300
<i>And so many people have tried</i>
<i>to come between us.</i>

134
00:11:58,926 --> 00:12:02,471
<i>And yet, here we are, stronger than ever.</i>

135
00:12:03,806 --> 00:12:06,600
<i>Our love is going</i>
<i>to last a lifetime, Lily.</i>

136
00:12:07,935 --> 00:12:09,186
<i>There's no turning back.</i>

137
00:12:24,785 --> 00:12:28,581
["Sa'Yo" by Silent Sanctuary playing]

138
00:13:43,239 --> 00:13:48,202
["Sa'Yo" by Silent Sanctuary
continues playing]

139
00:14:32,496 --> 00:14:34,081
[song fading]

140
00:14:36,709 --> 00:14:38,711
[tense music building]

141
00:15:09,199 --> 00:15:11,577
["Sa'Yo" instrumental playing]

142
00:15:16,332 --> 00:15:18,834
Remember that chubby
childhood friend of yours?

143
00:15:20,461 --> 00:15:21,462
The crybaby?

144
00:15:28,677 --> 00:15:30,179
You're the one who helped him.

145
00:15:31,722 --> 00:15:34,099
You're the one who taught
him how to be strong.

146
00:15:35,601 --> 00:15:37,478
You're the one who
taught him how to fight.

147
00:15:38,395 --> 00:15:43,275
And that's why he's here,
standing in front of you,

148
00:15:43,359 --> 00:15:45,778
fighting for his love for you.

149
00:15:56,705 --> 00:15:59,375
Lily, no matter how many times I fall,

150
00:15:59,458 --> 00:16:01,794
no matter how many times I get hurt…

151
00:16:03,921 --> 00:16:05,714
I'll never stop loving you.

152
00:16:09,927 --> 00:16:11,595
I love you so much, Lily.

153
00:16:13,806 --> 00:16:15,391
And I swear…

154
00:16:18,185 --> 00:16:23,357
that I'm going to love you
until my last breath.

155
00:16:27,236 --> 00:16:29,238
["Sa'Yo" instrumental playing]

156
00:16:48,757 --> 00:16:50,009
I grew up…

157
00:16:52,469 --> 00:16:54,304
with a hardened heart.

158
00:17:01,145 --> 00:17:02,479
But you…

159
00:17:05,649 --> 00:17:07,568
you're the one who made me feel,

160
00:17:08,569 --> 00:17:10,487
and showed me that…

161
00:17:12,948 --> 00:17:15,951
there are still good people in this world.

162
00:17:21,081 --> 00:17:22,708
Diego, you're the reason…

163
00:17:25,961 --> 00:17:27,713
I learned to love again.

164
00:17:34,511 --> 00:17:35,512
Thank you…

165
00:17:38,140 --> 00:17:40,017
for teaching me how to love.

166
00:17:50,360 --> 00:17:51,695
Thank you…

167
00:17:56,492 --> 00:17:58,911
Thank you for loving me…

168
00:18:01,580 --> 00:18:03,582
even though it's so difficult.

169
00:18:14,384 --> 00:18:19,598
That's why you, and the love we share…

170
00:18:21,183 --> 00:18:26,396
are among the very few
good things going on

171
00:18:26,480 --> 00:18:27,898
in my life right now.

172
00:18:33,028 --> 00:18:35,864
I'm so happy right now, Diego.

173
00:18:38,909 --> 00:18:40,369
I love you so much.

174
00:18:41,495 --> 00:18:43,372
I really do.

175
00:18:59,012 --> 00:19:01,098
["Sa'Yo" by Silent Sanctuary playing]

176
00:19:31,795 --> 00:19:33,714
["Sa'Yo" by Silent Sanctuary
continues playing]

177
00:19:37,426 --> 00:19:38,719
[priest] Diego…

178
00:19:39,094 --> 00:19:42,931
do you take Lily to be
your lawfully wedded wife,

179
00:19:43,015 --> 00:19:45,767
your other half, to have and to hold,

180
00:19:45,851 --> 00:19:49,521
from this day forward,
for better or worse,

181
00:19:49,605 --> 00:19:55,611
in sickness and in health,
to love and cherish forevermore?

182
00:19:55,694 --> 00:19:56,695
I do, Father.

183
00:19:59,573 --> 00:20:00,490
[priest] Lily…

184
00:20:03,368 --> 00:20:06,997
do you take Diego to be
your lawfully wedded husband,

185
00:20:07,080 --> 00:20:09,416
your other half, to have and to hold,

186
00:20:09,499 --> 00:20:13,378
from this day forward,
for better or worse,

187
00:20:13,462 --> 00:20:19,927
in sickness and in health,
to love and cherish forevermore?

188
00:20:20,928 --> 00:20:23,513
I do, Father. I do.

189
00:20:24,556 --> 00:20:27,517
["Sa'Yo" by Silent Sanctuary
continues playing]

190
00:20:41,573 --> 00:20:43,575
[song fading]

191
00:20:44,368 --> 00:20:46,370
[ominous music building]

192
00:21:27,494 --> 00:21:28,912
[cocks gun]

193
00:21:59,026 --> 00:22:03,363
Lily, I offer you this ring…

194
00:22:09,161 --> 00:22:12,914
as a symbol of my eternal love
and faithfulness to you.

195
00:22:19,254 --> 00:22:21,256
[suspenseful music playing]

196
00:22:52,788 --> 00:22:57,167
Diego, wear this ring…

197
00:23:00,462 --> 00:23:06,718
as a symbol of my eternal love
and faithfulness to you.

198
00:23:19,314 --> 00:23:21,358
[tense music playing]

199
00:23:44,464 --> 00:23:46,508
[suspenseful music playing]

200
00:24:04,484 --> 00:24:05,944
[phone vibrating]

201
00:24:08,280 --> 00:24:09,531
[phone vibrating]

202
00:24:12,242 --> 00:24:13,660
[phone vibrating]

203
00:24:15,078 --> 00:24:16,288
GRANDPA

204
00:24:16,371 --> 00:24:17,831
[phone vibrating]

205
00:24:35,098 --> 00:24:37,976
As a representative of the church,

206
00:24:38,894 --> 00:24:46,234
I hereby authorize
and bless your marriage.

207
00:24:46,943 --> 00:24:49,029
Now, you may kiss the bride.

208
00:25:35,033 --> 00:25:38,036
["Hindi Kita Iiwan" playing]

209
00:25:57,097 --> 00:25:59,099
[applause]

210
00:26:33,925 --> 00:26:35,885
[song fading]

211
00:26:41,057 --> 00:26:43,101
[tense music playing]

212
00:27:00,827 --> 00:27:02,579
[groaning]

213
00:27:11,296 --> 00:27:16,426
[mumbles] This isn't happening.
This isn't happening.

214
00:27:17,719 --> 00:27:19,637
No, you're not gonna get everything.

215
00:27:19,721 --> 00:27:22,098
No, you're not gonna get a happy ending.

216
00:27:23,141 --> 00:27:24,017
[indistinct]

217
00:27:24,100 --> 00:27:28,021
No. No. No! No!

218
00:27:36,279 --> 00:27:37,280
No!

219
00:27:38,114 --> 00:27:41,951
No. Wake up. Wake up! Wake up.

220
00:27:42,577 --> 00:27:46,122
You suffered because of them.
You suffered because of them.

221
00:27:46,206 --> 00:27:47,457
You suffered because of them.

222
00:27:54,172 --> 00:27:55,382
[line ringing]

223
00:27:56,925 --> 00:27:59,094
[phone vibrating]

224
00:28:00,804 --> 00:28:02,972
[phone vibrating]

225
00:28:04,933 --> 00:28:07,268
[phone vibrating]

226
00:28:09,270 --> 00:28:11,272
[phone vibrating]

227
00:28:12,941 --> 00:28:14,025
Hello, Grandpa.

228
00:28:14,943 --> 00:28:16,152
Arnaldo, where are you?

229
00:28:16,736 --> 00:28:18,196
I found Lily and Diego.

230
00:28:21,074 --> 00:28:22,951
And guess what? They just got married.

231
00:28:24,911 --> 00:28:26,162
I wasn't invited.

232
00:28:28,665 --> 00:28:34,504
Well then, you better leave
before someone sees you there.

233
00:28:40,176 --> 00:28:42,679
You know what's funny here?

234
00:28:45,598 --> 00:28:47,100
I thought I had them fooled.

235
00:28:48,226 --> 00:28:50,937
<i>I thought I gained their trust.</i>

236
00:28:53,022 --> 00:28:54,065
<i>I was wrong.</i>

237
00:28:55,567 --> 00:28:56,860
The joke's on me.

238
00:28:58,653 --> 00:29:00,155
I'm the idiot.

239
00:29:01,281 --> 00:29:04,576
Come home. Leave them there.
I promise you.

240
00:29:05,493 --> 00:29:08,788
We'll get back at them
when the time is right.

241
00:29:11,082 --> 00:29:12,584
Grandpa, I'm sorry I failed you again.

242
00:29:18,715 --> 00:29:22,510
But I want to thank you
for always taking care of me.

243
00:29:22,594 --> 00:29:24,971
[ominous music]

244
00:29:27,932 --> 00:29:28,933
I love you.

245
00:29:32,145 --> 00:29:35,398
And I love you too, my son.
You always remember that.

246
00:29:38,151 --> 00:29:39,152
Now, come home.

247
00:29:39,861 --> 00:29:43,364
We'll have a couple of drinks
and enjoy the night, okay?

248
00:29:45,492 --> 00:29:46,493
I'll be waiting.

249
00:29:48,578 --> 00:29:49,621
Bye, Grandpa.

250
00:29:57,921 --> 00:29:58,922
[cocks gun]

251
00:30:15,063 --> 00:30:17,941
[happy music playing]

252
00:30:36,501 --> 00:30:38,002
[Lily] Hello!

253
00:30:38,086 --> 00:30:39,087
[Camia] They're here!

254
00:30:39,170 --> 00:30:41,881
[applause]

255
00:30:41,965 --> 00:30:43,007
[Diego] Careful.

256
00:30:43,091 --> 00:30:45,885
[glasses clinking]

257
00:30:45,969 --> 00:30:48,263
-[Lily] Do you want us to kiss?
-[Camia] Yeah.

258
00:30:48,346 --> 00:30:49,806
-[Jepoy] Kiss!
-[Marlon] Kiss!

259
00:30:52,725 --> 00:30:54,644
Okay. You liked that, huh?

260
00:30:56,145 --> 00:30:58,189
[uplifting instrumental playing]

261
00:31:24,090 --> 00:31:26,175
[glasses clinking]

262
00:31:27,677 --> 00:31:29,512
[applause]

263
00:31:31,347 --> 00:31:33,224
-Have a big bite!
-Do it at the same time.

264
00:31:35,935 --> 00:31:37,353
[applause]

265
00:31:41,774 --> 00:31:43,818
-[Camia] Cheers or kiss?
-[Marlon] Cheers.

266
00:31:43,902 --> 00:31:44,944
[Diego] I hear kiss. Kiss.

267
00:31:57,290 --> 00:31:59,667
[Diego] <i>Remember that chubby</i>
<i>childhood friend of yours?</i>

268
00:32:17,477 --> 00:32:19,228
[priest] <i>You may now kiss the bride.</i>

269
00:32:19,312 --> 00:32:21,522
[applause]

270
00:32:32,158 --> 00:32:34,160
[applause]

271
00:32:37,080 --> 00:32:38,289
Thank you.

272
00:32:39,791 --> 00:32:42,168
[Camia] Lily, dear, Diego…

273
00:32:43,169 --> 00:32:45,171
I'm so happy for you both.

274
00:32:45,797 --> 00:32:48,716
Despite all your hardships,

275
00:32:48,800 --> 00:32:50,301
you still managed to fulfill your dreams.

276
00:32:51,177 --> 00:32:55,598
So, promise me you'll both
take care of each other, okay?

277
00:32:56,724 --> 00:32:57,725
I promise, Mom.

278
00:32:58,351 --> 00:32:59,352
I promise.

279
00:33:12,073 --> 00:33:14,659
What about you guys?
Aren't you going to give us a hug?

280
00:33:14,742 --> 00:33:15,910
-Group hug?
-Give us a group hug.

281
00:33:15,994 --> 00:33:19,956
-Everybody.
-Thanks, everyone.

282
00:33:41,769 --> 00:33:43,813
[upbeat instrumental playing]

283
00:33:54,365 --> 00:33:57,660
Thank you for making this
the happiest day of my life.

284
00:34:00,705 --> 00:34:06,711
I think I'm the happiest
and luckiest guy on earth.

285
00:34:08,963 --> 00:34:10,298
Thank you…

286
00:34:12,592 --> 00:34:14,302
Mrs. Lily Cruz-Torillo.

287
00:34:16,929 --> 00:34:18,264
-It sounds nice.
-Hmm.

288
00:34:18,806 --> 00:34:20,266
Lily Cruz-Torillo.

289
00:34:23,561 --> 00:34:24,854
I'm really happy too.

290
00:34:28,149 --> 00:34:29,859
Let's enjoy the night.

291
00:34:31,194 --> 00:34:32,695
Because first thing tomorrow,

292
00:34:33,905 --> 00:34:36,574
we'll continue working towards our dream

293
00:34:36,657 --> 00:34:40,286
of having a peaceful and happy town.

294
00:34:42,371 --> 00:34:43,915
We will live in Ardiente.

295
00:34:45,958 --> 00:34:48,669
We'll raise our children here.

296
00:34:50,671 --> 00:34:52,298
We'll start a family here.

297
00:34:54,175 --> 00:34:58,221
And no one will ever have
to experience the suffering

298
00:34:58,304 --> 00:35:00,056
we've endured
at the hands of the Ardientes.

299
00:35:03,768 --> 00:35:07,647
Your dream is my dream too.

300
00:35:09,273 --> 00:35:12,193
And my battles are your battles too.

301
00:35:15,488 --> 00:35:19,951
Remember, Diego.
It's you and me. Till the end.

302
00:35:22,286 --> 00:35:25,957
[romantic instrumental playing]

303
00:36:13,087 --> 00:36:16,007
["Sa'Yo" instrumental playing]

304
00:36:25,600 --> 00:36:29,145
["Sa'Yo" by Silent Sanctuary playing]

305
00:38:25,511 --> 00:38:28,514
["Sa'Yo" by Silent Sanctuary
continues playing]

306
00:39:26,280 --> 00:39:30,076
["Sa'Yo" by Silent Sanctuary
continues playing]

307
00:40:21,085 --> 00:40:23,170
[song fading]

308
00:40:25,923 --> 00:40:27,925
[suspenseful music playing]

309
00:40:40,896 --> 00:40:41,897
[thunder rumbling]

310
00:40:45,359 --> 00:40:46,402
[thunder rumbling]

311
00:40:57,455 --> 00:40:58,789
[thunder rumbling]

312
00:41:05,796 --> 00:41:07,798
[suspenseful music playing]

313
00:41:12,178 --> 00:41:13,762
[thunder rumbling]

314
00:41:52,218 --> 00:41:54,220
[suspenseful music playing]

315
00:42:02,269 --> 00:42:03,270
[thunder rumbling]

316
00:42:56,574 --> 00:42:57,575
[thunder rumbling]

317
00:43:13,591 --> 00:43:14,967
[thunder rumbling]

318
00:43:20,931 --> 00:43:22,308
[thunder rumbling]

319
00:43:42,119 --> 00:43:45,247
<i>Lily… Hello…</i>

320
00:43:47,291 --> 00:43:48,208
<i>Dad?</i>

321
00:43:49,877 --> 00:43:50,878
<i>Yes, Lily. It's me.</i>

322
00:43:52,463 --> 00:43:53,464
<i>Dad!</i>

323
00:44:09,938 --> 00:44:12,358
<i>Dad, what are you doing here?</i>

324
00:44:13,359 --> 00:44:16,945
<i>Lily, I'm so happy you've</i>
<i>finally found the one for you.</i>

325
00:44:18,572 --> 00:44:20,074
<i>But be careful, okay?</i>

326
00:44:20,658 --> 00:44:22,576
<i>You still have enemies around.</i>

327
00:44:23,786 --> 00:44:25,371
<i>Never leave each other's side.</i>

328
00:44:26,080 --> 00:44:27,081
<i>Of course, Dad.</i>

329
00:44:33,462 --> 00:44:36,715
<i>Lily, your lives are in danger. Wake up.</i>

330
00:44:36,799 --> 00:44:38,801
[ominous music]

331
00:44:42,846 --> 00:44:44,348
[thunder rumbling]

332
00:45:36,900 --> 00:45:38,902
[suspenseful music playing]

333
00:46:38,670 --> 00:46:40,172
[glass shattering]

334
00:46:40,589 --> 00:46:42,216
[Arnaldo] <i>Leave Diego! It's just us now.</i>

335
00:46:42,299 --> 00:46:44,718
<i>So, you're all mine. You're all mine!</i>

336
00:46:44,801 --> 00:46:45,802
<i>Get your hands off my wife!</i>

337
00:46:45,886 --> 00:46:51,225
[Lily] <i>As long as you live, no one</i>
<i>will ever love you, Arnaldo!</i>

338
00:46:51,308 --> 00:46:54,061
<i>No one! Because you're a monster!</i>

339
00:46:54,144 --> 00:46:57,356
<i>And even if you let me live,</i>
<i>I will never love you!</i>

340
00:46:57,439 --> 00:46:59,233
<i>I will never love you!</i>

341
00:46:59,316 --> 00:47:01,401
<i>I will never love a criminal!</i>

342
00:47:01,485 --> 00:47:04,071
-[screams]
-[gunshot]

343
00:47:04,154 --> 00:47:05,906
<i>It came from the governor's mansion!</i>

344
00:47:05,989 --> 00:47:08,116
<i>I am coming for you!</i>

345
00:47:08,200 --> 00:47:12,037
<i>I will be coming for each</i>
<i>and every one of you!</i>

346
00:47:12,120 --> 00:47:13,956
[theme music playing]
